## 3. Introduction

The **CodeVerse CyberQuest: Junior Cybersecurity Analyst Challenge** is a hands-on capstone assessment designed to bridge foundational cybersecurity theory and practical defensive/offensive security analysis. Modern enterprise environments face threats across multiple layers simultaneously: web-facing authentication portals, cryptographic data protection implementations, and underlying Linux server permissions.

The objective of this report is to consolidate the technical methodology, verified laboratory evidence, impact analysis, and prioritized engineering remediations across all five CyberQuest challenges into a formal security assessment deliverable.

